{"at": "2026-09-17T07:32:05.032539+00:00", "event_id": "01M2Q4F8982H3JPN21YDW7CJ3J", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M2Q4F897ANB84HA6EHA9DG98", "input_key": "message_partition_breadth", "mission_id": "01M2Q4E0YS3TP1K9H6KFPQWXB5", "mission_slug": "blocked-planned-refusal-message-01M2Q4E0", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["reachability-based (blocked+canceled+done)", "blocked-only (narrowest diff)", "Other"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "How broadly should the source-aware refusal message apply: only the blocked source lane, or every lane where planned is structurally unreachable?", "recorded_at": "2026-09-17T07:32:05.032539Z", "run_id": "01M2Q4F897ANB84HA6EHA9DG98", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-17T07:32:05.031959Z", "step_id": "specify.message.partition-breadth"}}
{"at": "2026-09-17T08:21:28.806934+00:00", "event_id": "01M2Q79PK6S8JQCCYAMCQVRM8A", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M2Q4F897ANB84HA6EHA9DG98", "final_answer": "Reachability-based, message-only. Source lanes where planned is structurally unreachable (blocked, canceled, done) get a legal-targets refusal naming their real recovery (blocked -> resume via --to in_progress or cancel via --to canceled; canceled/done -> terminal, no targets). Review-family lanes where planned IS reachable (in_review, in_progress, approved, genesis) keep the existing review-feedback guidance. FSM allow/deny is untouched; the guard stays unconditional and force-proof. Operator confirmed blocked->in_progress is the intended one-hop resume and declined expanding scope to legalize blocked->planned.", "mission_id": "01M2Q4E0YS3TP1K9H6KFPQWXB5", "mission_slug": "blocked-planned-refusal-message-01M2Q4E0", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-17T08:21:28.806934Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M2Q4F897ANB84HA6EHA9DG98", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-17T08:21:28.806209Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
